1
00:00:03,000 --> 00:00:04,920
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>[YUTA]
With supplies being limited,</b></font>

2
00:00:04,960 --> 00:00:07,090
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>we'll need to add a rule
allowing passage</b></font>

3
00:00:07,130 --> 00:00:08,590
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>in and out of the colony.</b></font>

4
00:00:09,550 --> 00:00:12,140
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>But I can't afford
to let players like Dhruv,</b></font>

5
00:00:12,180 --> 00:00:14,560
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>who attack people
indiscriminately,</b></font>

6
00:00:14,600 --> 00:00:16,100
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>leave the barriers.</b></font>

7
00:00:16,600 --> 00:00:19,190
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>I should wait until the players
like him are eliminated</b></font>

8
00:00:19,230 --> 00:00:21,190
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>from the other colonies first.</b></font>

9
00:00:21,230 --> 00:00:24,070
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>Communication between colonies
is a must.</b></font>

10
00:00:24,110 --> 00:00:26,400
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>There's the two rules
Fushiguro proposed.</b></font>

11
00:00:26,440 --> 00:00:27,650
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>A means of communication,</b></font>

12
00:00:27,700 --> 00:00:29,610
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>and passage
in and out of the colonies.</b></font>

13
00:00:29,660 --> 00:00:31,200
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>So we'll need
four additional rules</b></font>

14
00:00:31,240 --> 00:00:33,240
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>to get the situation
under control.</b></font>

15
00:00:33,530 --> 00:00:36,410
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>Everyone's still at their
physical and emotional limit</b></font>

16
00:00:36,450 --> 00:00:37,620
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>from Shibuya.</b></font>

17
00:00:38,870 --> 00:00:40,170
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>Gojo.</b></font>

18
00:00:40,210 --> 00:00:43,210
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>I won't let you kill
your best friend twice.</b></font>

19
00:00:44,340 --> 00:00:46,880
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>I'll kill Kenjaku myself.</b></font>

20
00:00:46,920 --> 00:00:49,760
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>I'll get the 400 points
on my own.</b></font>

21
00:00:49,800 --> 00:00:52,850
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>JUJUTSU KAISEN</b></font>

22
00:00:56,680 --> 00:00:58,480
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>Okay, you can all come out now.</b></font>

23
00:00:59,100 --> 00:01:01,100
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>I think we should continue
making our way north</b></font>

24
00:01:01,140 --> 00:01:02,650
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>to the edge of the barrier.</b></font>

25
00:01:02,690 --> 00:01:04,020
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>[GIRL] Can you carry me?</b></font>

26
00:01:04,480 --> 00:01:06,230
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>[MOTHER]
Just hang in there, sweetheart.</b></font>

27
00:01:06,270 --> 00:01:08,150
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>Why don't we take a quick rest?</b></font>

28
00:01:08,190 --> 00:01:09,150
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>We're safe here.</b></font>

29
00:01:09,190 --> 00:01:10,780
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>This stadium
was being controlled</b></font>

30
00:01:10,820 --> 00:01:12,450
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>by the sorcerer I just defeated.</b></font>

31
00:01:12,490 --> 00:01:15,780
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>Any player that comes along
will be pretty hesitant to--</b></font>

32
00:01:15,830 --> 00:01:17,120
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>-[rumbling]
-[MAN 1] What's that sound?</b></font>

33
00:01:20,790 --> 00:01:23,120
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>[YUTA] Quick.
Get into the stadium.</b></font>

34
00:01:23,170 --> 00:01:24,170
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>[MAN 2] Let's go!</b></font>

35
00:01:24,210 --> 00:01:26,380
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>-[panicked chatter]
-Hurry up.</b></font>

36
00:01:26,420 --> 00:01:29,920
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>[men panting, whimpering]</b></font>

37
00:01:29,970 --> 00:01:31,220
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>[man in blue hoodie screams]</b></font>

38
00:01:31,260 --> 00:01:32,260
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>[gasps]</b></font>

39
00:01:33,550 --> 00:01:35,010
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>Help! Help me!</b></font>

40
00:01:37,180 --> 00:01:38,140
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>[grunts]</b></font>

41
00:01:38,180 --> 00:01:39,520
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>[♪ intense music playing]</b></font>

42
00:01:40,980 --> 00:01:43,690
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>[YUTA] Wait,
are these cockroaches real?</b></font>

43
00:01:44,100 --> 00:01:45,400
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>[vomits]</b></font>

44
00:01:45,440 --> 00:01:46,480
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>[YUTA] Damn!</b></font>

45
00:01:52,030 --> 00:01:54,410
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>-Rika, knock it down!
-[MAN 1] Hurry!</b></font>

46
00:01:55,490 --> 00:01:56,910
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>-[RIKA] Okay!
-[girl whimpers]</b></font>

47
00:01:56,950 --> 00:01:57,990
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>[MAN 1] Run!</b></font>

48
00:02:00,790 --> 00:02:02,410
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>♪</b></font>

49
00:02:10,510 --> 00:02:13,970
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>-Kogane, is that a player?
-Yes.</b></font>

50
00:02:14,010 --> 00:02:16,760
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>That is a player
called Kurourushi.</b></font>

51
00:02:17,850 --> 00:02:20,720
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>[YUTA] So some players
are cursed spirits.</b></font>

52
00:02:21,310 --> 00:02:24,440
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>EPISODE 59
SENDAI COLONY</b></font>

53
00:02:27,610 --> 00:02:29,650
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>FESTERING LIFE SWORD</b></font>

54
00:02:31,990 --> 00:02:33,150
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>[whooshing]</b></font>

55
00:02:34,360 --> 00:02:35,410
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>[slashes]</b></font>

56
00:02:35,740 --> 00:02:36,870
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>[clangs, thuds]</b></font>

57
00:02:36,910 --> 00:02:37,950
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>[grunts]</b></font>

58
00:02:46,540 --> 00:02:47,540
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>[grunts]</b></font>

59
00:02:47,880 --> 00:02:49,000
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>[YUTA] I'm being watched.</b></font>

60
00:02:49,800 --> 00:02:52,590
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>Likely, it's the other
two players with high points.</b></font>

61
00:02:52,970 --> 00:02:55,220
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>[KUROURUSHI]
Why do you interfere?</b></font>

62
00:02:55,260 --> 00:02:57,550
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>[YUTA]
Kurourushi is a cursed spirit.</b></font>

63
00:02:57,590 --> 00:03:00,060
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>[KUROURUSHI] Why do you kill us?</b></font>

64
00:03:00,640 --> 00:03:02,020
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>[YUTA] I can exorcise it.</b></font>

65
00:03:02,060 --> 00:03:03,930
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>I just have to drive
positive energy</b></font>

66
00:03:03,980 --> 00:03:07,150
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>from my reverse cursed technique
into its body.</b></font>

67
00:03:07,770 --> 00:03:09,730
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>I can ask you the same question.</b></font>

68
00:03:09,940 --> 00:03:10,980
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>But...</b></font>

69
00:03:11,270 --> 00:03:14,650
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>[KUROURUSHI] Because
I like the taste of iron!</b></font>

70
00:03:17,990 --> 00:03:19,570
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>[YUTA] I don't want
those other two players</b></font>

71
00:03:19,620 --> 00:03:22,370
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>to know I can use
reverse cursed technique.</b></font>

72
00:03:22,410 --> 00:03:25,040
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>Rika's protecting everyone
in the stadium.</b></font>

73
00:03:25,080 --> 00:03:27,210
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>So I have to
exorcise Kurourushi</b></font>

74
00:03:27,250 --> 00:03:30,380
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>without using Rika
or my reverse cursed technique.</b></font>

75
00:03:33,420 --> 00:03:34,460
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>[clangs]</b></font>

76
00:03:35,300 --> 00:03:36,380
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>[KUROURUSHI] Blinding.</b></font>

77
00:03:36,420 --> 00:03:37,550
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>Blinding.</b></font>

78
00:03:37,590 --> 00:03:38,970
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>Blinding.</b></font>

79
