<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>[grunts]</b></font>

81
00:04:07,160 --> 00:04:08,420
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>[grunts]</b></font>

82
00:04:10,130 --> 00:04:11,210
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>[gasps]</b></font>

83
00:04:12,340 --> 00:04:13,460
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>[grunts]</b></font>

84
00:04:13,840 --> 00:04:15,170
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>[sword clanging]</b></font>

85
00:04:15,840 --> 00:04:17,760
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>[Kurourushi growls]</b></font>

86
00:04:17,800 --> 00:04:19,050
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>[slashes]</b></font>

87
00:04:21,550 --> 00:04:22,600
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>[coughs]</b></font>

88
00:04:24,470 --> 00:04:26,770
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>-[mini Kuros squealing]
-[Yuta groans]</b></font>

89
00:04:27,520 --> 00:04:28,560
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>[groans]</b></font>

90
00:04:30,230 --> 00:04:31,520
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>[breathing laboriously]</b></font>

91
00:04:32,900 --> 00:04:34,070
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>[grunts]</b></font>

92
00:04:34,570 --> 00:04:35,940
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>[struggling breaths]</b></font>

93
00:04:35,980 --> 00:04:37,780
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>[Kurourushi growls]</b></font>

94
00:04:38,700 --> 00:04:39,700
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>[Yuta grunts]</b></font>

95
00:04:39,990 --> 00:04:41,320
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>-[bites]
-[Kurourushi gasps]</b></font>

96
00:04:42,740 --> 00:04:44,530
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>[wind whooshing]</b></font>

97
00:04:45,830 --> 00:04:47,120
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>[cracking]</b></font>

98
00:04:51,880 --> 00:04:54,290
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>[KOGANE] You have gained
five points for a kill.</b></font>

99
00:04:54,340 --> 00:04:56,210
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>[TAKAKO] I see
that you can use...</b></font>

100
00:04:56,880 --> 00:04:59,090
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>-...reverse cursed technique.
-[gasps]</b></font>

101
00:05:04,970 --> 00:05:06,010
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>[Yuta grunts]</b></font>

102
00:05:06,470 --> 00:05:07,560
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>[YUTA] What was that?</b></font>

103
00:05:07,600 --> 00:05:09,350
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>-A strike?
-[Takako grunts]</b></font>

104
00:05:10,600 --> 00:05:11,730
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>[grunts]</b></font>

105
00:05:14,480 --> 00:05:15,900
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>[glass shatters]</b></font>

106
00:05:19,240 --> 00:05:20,820
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>[YUTA] My arm is back to normal.</b></font>

107
00:05:20,860 --> 00:05:21,990
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>I feel fine.</b></font>

108
00:05:22,240 --> 00:05:25,080
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>Her technique probably
manipulates space.</b></font>

109
00:05:25,120 --> 00:05:26,740
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>But I guess
she can't use that space</b></font>

110
00:05:26,790 --> 00:05:28,250
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>to crush her opponents.</b></font>

111
00:05:28,290 --> 00:05:31,370
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>It seems to create distortions
like a funhouse mirror.</b></font>

112
00:05:31,960 --> 00:05:34,080
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>[TAKAKO] You're wondering
about my technique?</b></font>

113
00:05:34,130 --> 00:05:36,750
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>It treats the sky as a surface.</b></font>

114
00:05:38,380 --> 00:05:39,920
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>Here, let me show you.</b></font>

115
00:05:39,970 --> 00:05:42,010
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>[YUTA]
She's revealing her technique.</b></font>

116
00:05:42,590 --> 00:05:44,760
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>[TAKAKO]
Hurry up and attack already.</b></font>

117
00:05:45,260 --> 00:05:46,510
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>[YUTA] I have to ask.</b></font>

118
00:05:46,550 --> 00:05:47,930
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>You're not someone
who's gonna complain</b></font>

119
00:05:47,970 --> 00:05:49,930
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>about getting killed, are you?</b></font>

120
00:05:49,980 --> 00:05:51,140
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>I mean, I can understand</b></font>

121
00:05:51,230 --> 00:05:53,730
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>powerless people
getting desperate for points,</b></font>

122
00:05:53,770 --> 00:05:55,020
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>but a strong person like you</b></font>

123
00:05:55,060 --> 00:05:56,820
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>can claim points
whenever they want.</b></font>

124
00:05:57,480 --> 00:06:00,150
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>So what's your reason
for actively seeking a fight?</b></font>

125
00:06:00,400 --> 00:06:01,900
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>[TAKAKO] This little brat.</b></font>

126
00:06:02,150 --> 00:06:03,360
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>Seriously?</b></font>

127
00:06:03,740 --> 00:06:06,660
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>Are you modern-day sorcerers
that casual about incarnation?</b></font>

128
00:06:06,700 --> 00:06:08,160
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>To us from the old school,</b></font>

129
00:06:08,200 --> 00:06:10,450
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>this means coming back
from the dead.</b></font>

130
00:06:10,500 --> 00:06:13,080
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>People who lived out
their lives without regrets</b></font>

131
00:06:13,120 --> 00:06:15,670
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>wouldn't accept
Kenjaku's offer, would they?</b></font>

132
00:06:16,130 --> 00:06:17,920
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>He's really pissing me off.</b></font>

133
00:06:17,960 --> 00:06:19,550
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>I like to think
of the Culling Game</b></font>

134
00:06:19,590 --> 00:06:22,630
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>as the first step toward
a chance at a second life.</b></font>

135
00:06:22,670 --> 00:06:25,840
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>Keep in mind that Kenjaku
set the stage for this.</b></font>

136
00:06:25,890 --> 00:06:27,430
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>Anything could happen.</b></font>

137
00:06:27,470 --> 00:06:29,970
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>We need to earn points
to prepare ourselves.</b></font>

138
00:06:30,020 --> 00:06:33,190
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>I wonder if someone like you
has any friends or lovers.</b></font>

139
00:06:35,020 --> 00:06:36,060
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>Huh?</b></font>

140
00:06:36,690 --> 00:06:37,900
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>You know what?</b></font>

141
00:06:38,020 --> 00:06:40,150
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>Until recently, I didn't
have any friends either.</b></font>

142
00:06:40,190 --> 00:06:41,650
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>Not that I feel sorry for you.</b></font>

143
00:06:42,070 --> 00:06:43,740
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>[TAKAKO] Hmm, this feeling.</b></font>

144
00:06:43,780 --> 00:06:46,530
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>It's like he's hunting
for things that trigger me.</b></font>

145
00:06:47,280 --> 00:06:49,660
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>[YUTA] Your pain was caused
thousands of years ago.</b></font>

146
00:06:49,700 --> 00:06:52,330
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>The people alive today have
nothing to do with your regrets.</b></font>

147
00:06:52,370 --> 00:06:55,670
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>How many have to die
until you finally feel avenged?</b></font>

148
00:06:56,170 --> 00:06:57,380
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>Wait just a minute.</b></font>

149
00:06:57,960 --> 00:07:00,050
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>Are you one of the Fujiwara?</b></font>

150
00:07:00,420 --> 00:07:02,590
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>How can anyone
from your bloodline</b></font>

151
00:07:02,630 --> 00:07:04,220
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>understand me?</b></font>

152
00:07:06,340 --> 00:07:07,550
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>[Yuta grunts]</b></font>

153
00:07:08,930 --> 00:07:10,810
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>[Takako grunting]</b></font>

154
00:07:10,850 --> 00:07:12,350
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>[Takako growling]</b></font>

155
00:07:14,520 --> 00:07:16,400
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>[RYU] Granite Blast.</b></font>

156
00:07:25,610 --> 00:07:26,950
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>[YUTA] Ishigori?</b></font>

157
00:07:27,200 --> 00:07:29,030
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>[TAKAKO]
It came from that rooftop.</b></font>

158
00:07:29,070 --> 00:07:30,700
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>Too close for comfort.</b></font>

159
00:07:31,200 --> 00:07:33,410
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>[YUTA] Even with Rika
protecting the stadium,</b></font>

160
00:07:33,450 --> 00:07:36,040
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>a direct hit from an attack
on that level</b></font>

161
00:07:36,080 --> 00:07:37,790
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>will leave several people dead.</b></font>

162
00:07:37,830 --> 00:07:40,290
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>So I have to take
Ishigori out first.</b></font>

163
00:07:40,340 --> 00:07:42,710
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>[TAKAKO] Now that Kurourushi
and Dhruv are gone,</b></font>

164
00:07:42,750 --> 00:07:45,550
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>I have no reason
to let Ishigori run free.</b></font>

165
00:07:45,590 --> 00:07:47,380
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>I'll take both him
and Okkotsu...</b></font>

166
00:07:47,430 --> 00:07:48,680
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>-[YUTA] Now.
-[TAKAKO]...out.</b></font>

167
00:07:50,260 --> 00:07:52,180
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>[RYU] Granite Blast!</b></font>

168
00:08:05,030 --> 00:08:06,360
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>Come on.</b></font>

169
00:08:06,400 --> 00:08:08,320
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>Don't disappoint me.</b></font>

170
00:08:10,070 --> 00:08:11,280
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>He's gone?</b></font>

171
00:08:11,330 --> 00:08:14,240
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>No. That's where Okkotsu
dug a hole earlier.</b></font>

172
00:08:19,120 --> 00:08:20,130
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>Can't you fight</b></font>

173
00:08:20,290 --> 00:08:21,710
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>without blowing up
everything around you?</b></font>

174
00:08:22,000 --> 00:08:25,880
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>Oh, but that won't satisfy
my hunger, Okkotsu.</b></font>

175
00:08:27,130 --> 00:08:28,840
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>JUJUTSU KAISEN</b></font>

176
00:08:30,090 --> 00:08:33,430
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>Would you tell a starving kid
with a feast in front of him</b></font>

177
00:08:33,470 --> 00:08:36,020
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>to take his time and eat slower?</b></font>

178
00:08:37,430 --> 00:08:38,730
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>[YUTA] Wouldn't anyone?</b></font>

179
00:08:40,150 --> 00:08:41,270
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>[RYU] I guess so.</b></font>

180
00:08:41,310 --> 00:08:42,690
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>Most probably would.</b></font>

181
00:08:42,730 --> 00:08:43,940
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>That was a bad example.</b></font>

182
00:08:45,110 --> 00:08:49,200
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>My first run at life wasn't
completely lacking flavor.</b></font>

183
00:08:49,240 --> 00:08:52,530
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>Some of the guys I fought
had real backbone.</b></font>

184
00:08:52,570 --> 00:08:54,910
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>I even met a nice woman, too.</b></font>

185
00:08:54,950 --> 00:08:58,500
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>Frankly, it'd be hard to say
I had any regrets at all.</b></font>

186
00:09:00,870 --> 00:09:03,340
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>This vague hunger
I constantly feel</b></font>

187
00:09:03,380 --> 00:09:06,210
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>is always gnawing
at me, Okkotsu.</b></font>

188
00:09:06,250 --> 00:09:10,010
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>Everyone's always wondering
what I'm so unsatisfied about.</b></font>

189
00:09:11,630 --> 00:09:15,310
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>These cigarettes have
a slightly sweet aftertaste.</b></font>

190
00:09:17,020 --> 00:09:18,310
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>You know what it was?</b></font>

191
00:09:18,770 --> 00:09:20,890
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>There was no dessert in my life.</b></font>

192
00:09:21,980 --> 00:09:23,100
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>[YUTA] Here it comes.</b></font>

193
00:09:23,150 --> 00:09:24,400
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>[thuds]</b></font>

194
00:09:27,280 --> 00:09:28,280
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>[laughs]</b></font>

195
00:09:28,320 --> 00:09:29,530
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>[punching]</b></font>

196
00:09:31,360 --> 00:09:33,700
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>[RYU] Why am I unsatisfied?</b></font>

197
00:09:34,160 --> 00:09:36,080
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>I think you know!</b></font>

198
00:09:39,790 --> 00:09:41,160
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>-[gasps]
-[chuckles]</b></font>

199
00:09:42,920 --> 00:09:43,880
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>[groans]</b></font>

200
00:09:43,920 --> 00:09:45,500
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>[RYU] I'm unsatisfied</b></font>

201
00:09:45,540 --> 00:09:47,500
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>because I'm not fulfilled!</b></font>

202
00:09:50,670 --> 00:09:51,760
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>[grunts]</b></font>

203
00:09:52,090 --> 00:09:53,130
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>[Ryu grunts]</b></font>

204
00:09:57,970 --> 00:09:58,970
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>[gasps]</b></font>

205
00:10:01,060 --> 00:10:02,890
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>You'd better not be crushed.</b></font>

206
00:10:04,730 --> 00:10:05,860
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>[grunts]</b></font>

207
00:10:10,280 --> 00:10:11,450
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>[choking]</b></font>

208
00:10:12,320 --> 00:10:13,950
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>[grunting]</b></font>

209
00:10:15,370 --> 00:10:16,580
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>[grunts]</b></font>

210
00:10:17,700 --> 00:10:18,740
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>[grunts]</b></font>

211
00:10:19,740 --> 00:10:21,460
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>[RYU] Hey, watch the hair.</b></font>

212
00:10:26,040 --> 00:10:27,090
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>[grunts]</b></font>

213
00:10:38,430 --> 00:10:39,470
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>[YUTA] Nice.</b></font>

214
00:10:45,230 --> 00:10:48,150
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>[Ryu grunts]
Not calling your shikigami?</b></font>

215
00:10:49,690 --> 00:10:51,030
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>I can't right now.</b></font>

216
00:10:51,570 --> 00:10:53,530
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>Not with you going wild.</b></font>

217
00:10:53,570 --> 00:10:55,610
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>[RYU] Oh, that's a shame.</b></font>

218
00:10:56,570 --> 00:10:57,660
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>[running]</b></font>

219
00:10:58,780 --> 00:11:00,910
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>[YUTA] He's probably
trying to limit where I can go.</b></font>

220
00:11:01,870 --> 00:11:03,160
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>But I'll break through...</b></font>

221
00:11:04,580 --> 00:11:05,920
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>head - on!</b></font>

222
00:11:07,130 --> 00:11:08,590
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>Sweet!</b></font>

223
00:11:08,790 --> 00:11:10,170
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>That's it, Okkotsu!</b></font>

224
00:11:10,550 --> 00:11:12,090
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>Keep on coming!</b></font>

225
00:11:14,380 --> 00:11:16,800
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>[YUTA] His cursed energy,
so precise!</b></font>

226
00:11:22,560 --> 00:11:24,390
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>-Here's your reward!
-[gasps]</b></font>

227
00:11:28,400 --> 00:11:29,560
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>Uh-oh.</b></font>

228
00:11:30,110 --> 00:11:32,230
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>I overheated my hair.</b></font>

229
00:11:32,280 --> 00:11:33,230
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>[creaks]</b></font>

230
00:11:33,280 --> 00:11:34,360
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>[crashes]</b></font>

231
00:11:38,660 --> 00:11:39,780
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>[grunts]</b></font>

232
00:11:40,740 --> 00:11:42,450
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>[RYU] You're good, Okkotsu.</b></font>

233
00:11:42,870 --> 00:11:44,540
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>Could you be the one?</b></font>

234
00:11:44,580 --> 00:11:46,250
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>Are you my dessert?</b></font>

235
00:11:49,920 --> 00:11:50,960
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>[Yuta grunts]</b></font>

236
00:11:53,170 --> 00:11:54,510
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>You're great!</b></font>

237
00:11:54,550 --> 00:11:57,300
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>Best I've seen so far!</b></font>

238
00:12:01,430 --> 00:12:03,260
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>[TAKAKO]
What I strike isn't the person,</b></font>

239
00:12:03,760 --> 00:12:05,720
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>but the surface of the sky.</b></font>

240
00:12:05,770 --> 00:12:06,810
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>[shatters]</b></font>

241
00:12:07,480 --> 00:12:08,810
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>Thin Ice Breaker!</b></font>

242
00:12:12,070 --> 00:12:14,690
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>Get lost, you pile of vomit!</b></font>

243
00:12:17,530 --> 00:12:19,200
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>Shut your mouth,</b></font>

244
00:12:19,240 --> 00:12:21,240
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>-dick cheese!
-[gasps]</b></font>

245
00:12:23,120 --> 00:12:24,290
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>[chuckles]</b></font>

246
00:12:26,540 --> 00:12:28,370
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>This guy's resilient.</b></font>

247
00:12:28,420 --> 00:12:29,920
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>Glad you're alive.</b></font>

248
00:12:29,960 --> 00:12:32,000
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>I wanted to torment you
some more.</b></font>

249
00:12:32,670 --> 00:12:34,880
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>[groans] What a hit.</b></font>

250
00:12:34,920 --> 00:12:36,460
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>That was the first time
I've been forced</b></font>

251
00:12:36,510 --> 00:12:38,090
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>to eat my own technique.</b></font>

252
00:12:38,760 --> 00:12:41,430
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>Reverse cursed technique
is a pain to deal with,</b></font>

253
00:12:41,470 --> 00:12:44,060
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>but it burns cursed energy
like crazy.</b></font>

254
00:12:46,020 --> 00:12:49,730
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>We're finally seeing the bottom
of your reserves, Okkotsu.</b></font>

255
00:12:50,020 --> 00:12:52,610
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>No matter how high - end
the sweet shop is,</b></font>

256
00:12:52,650 --> 00:12:55,360
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>seeing the displays empty
at closing time</b></font>

257
00:12:55,400 --> 00:12:57,570
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>is always disappointing.</b></font>

258
00:12:58,280 --> 00:12:59,450
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>Guess it wasn't you.</b></font>

259
00:12:59,490 --> 00:13:01,780
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>[panting]</b></font>

260
00:13:05,620 --> 00:13:07,080
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>[YUTA] I wanted
to gain more distance</b></font>

261
00:13:07,120 --> 00:13:08,830
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>from everyone in the stadium,</b></font>

262
00:13:08,870 --> 00:13:10,790
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>keep them out of harm's way.</b></font>

263
00:13:10,830 --> 00:13:12,000
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>Oh, well.</b></font>

264
00:13:16,420 --> 00:13:18,340
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>Come to me, Rika.</b></font>

265
00:13:19,090 --> 00:13:20,680
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>Give me everything!</b></font>

266
00:13:21,300 --> 00:13:22,430
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>[both gasp]</b></font>

267
00:13:23,220 --> 00:13:25,890
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>[TAKAKO] His shikigami
completely manifested?</b></font>

268
00:13:25,930 --> 00:13:27,180
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>[RYU] How does that work?</b></font>

269
00:13:27,220 --> 00:13:29,930
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>And he's swelling
with cursed energy again!</b></font>

270
00:13:30,770 --> 00:13:33,440
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>[RIKA]
Which would you like, Yuta?</b></font>

271
00:13:34,270 --> 00:13:35,440
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>Thank you.</b></font>

272
00:13:35,480 --> 00:13:36,690
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>I'll take that one.</b></font>

273
00:13:37,320 --> 00:13:38,320
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>[chuckles]</b></font>

274
00:13:38,690 --> 00:13:41,110
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>[NARRATOR] Rika is
the stockpile of cursed energy</b></font>

275
00:13:41,150 --> 00:13:43,860
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>and the externalization
of Okkotsu's technique.</b></font>

276
00:13:43,910 --> 00:13:47,030
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>It remained with him
after Rika Orimoto passed on.</b></font>

277
00:13:47,370 --> 00:13:49,410
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>While connected to Rika
through the ring,</b></font>

278
00:13:49,450 --> 00:13:50,910
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>he gains the following.</b></font>

279
00:13:50,960 --> 00:13:52,620
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>Use of his cursed technique,</b></font>

280
00:13:52,670 --> 00:13:54,710
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>the complete manifestation
of Rika,</b></font>

281
00:13:54,750 --> 00:13:57,170
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>and the cursed energy
supplied by Rika.</b></font>

282
00:13:57,920 --> 00:14:00,340
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>Yuta can remain
connected to Rika</b></font>

283
00:14:00,380 --> 00:14:01,970
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>for five minutes.</b></font>

284
00:14:04,220 --> 00:14:05,260
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>[YUTA] Okay.</b></font>

285
00:14:05,800 --> 00:14:06,890
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>Let's go.</b></font>

286
00:14:07,890 --> 00:14:09,850
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>[TAKAKO] Don't
underestimate me. [gasps]</b></font>

287
00:14:12,810 --> 00:14:13,770
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>[Yuta hisses]</b></font>

288
00:14:14,060 --> 00:14:15,400
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>[YUTA] Don't move.</b></font>

289
00:14:15,810 --> 00:14:17,480
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>[TAKAKO] Snake eyes and fangs.</b></font>

290
00:14:17,520 --> 00:14:19,070
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>I can't move.</b></font>

291
00:14:20,740 --> 00:14:21,940
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>[punching]</b></font>

292
00:14:21,990 --> 00:14:23,450
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>[Takako groaning]</b></font>

293
00:14:23,900 --> 00:14:25,280
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>Oh, man.</b></font>

294
00:14:25,320 --> 00:14:27,160
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>You are super sweet, huh?</b></font>

295
00:14:27,530 --> 00:14:28,950
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>[Takako groaning]</b></font>

296
00:14:29,790 --> 00:14:30,790
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>[YUTA] Rika.</b></font>

297
00:14:30,830 --> 00:14:32,290
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>-[RIKA] Right!
-[RYU] Yeah!</b></font>

298
00:14:33,540 --> 00:14:34,620
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>[RYU] Oh, no!</b></font>

299
00:14:34,670 --> 00:14:35,710
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>[thuds]</b></font>

300
00:14:36,750 --> 00:14:37,920
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>[strains]</b></font>

301
00:14:40,340 --> 00:14:42,090
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>That was close! Huh?</b></font>

302
00:14:42,720 --> 00:14:45,840
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>[grunts] You can't
get rid of me that easy!</b></font>

303
00:14:45,880 --> 00:14:47,890
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>♪</b></font>

304
00:15:02,530 --> 00:15:03,490
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>[Takako grunts]</b></font>

305
00:15:03,530 --> 00:15:05,320
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>-[Ryu groans]
-[gasps]</b></font>

306
00:15:10,990 --> 00:15:12,040
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>[Yuta groans]</b></font>

307
00:15:12,700 --> 00:15:13,750
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>[Rika gasps]</b></font>

308
00:15:14,080 --> 00:15:15,250
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>[hisses]</b></font>

309
00:15:15,290 --> 00:15:16,500
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>[RIKA] You!</b></font>

310
00:15:16,540 --> 00:15:18,880
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>You hurt Yuta!</b></font>

311
00:15:20,040 --> 00:15:21,050
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>[Takako gasps]</b></font>

312
00:15:21,090 --> 00:15:22,090
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>[grunts]</b></font>

313
00:15:25,920 --> 00:15:26,970
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>[gasps]</b></font>

314
00:15:27,800 --> 00:15:29,430
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>[whooshing]</b></font>

315
00:15:29,470 --> 00:15:30,970
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>[YUTA] What now?</b></font>

316
00:15:31,680 --> 00:15:32,930
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>[RYU] Let's go!</b></font>

317
00:15:32,970 --> 00:15:34,140
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>[Yuta grunts]</b></font>

318
00:15:35,270 --> 00:15:36,270
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>[laughs]</b></font>

319
00:15:36,600 --> 00:15:38,900
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>[YUTA] Even with this,
I can't fully block it.</b></font>

320
00:15:42,480 --> 00:15:44,400
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>-Wanna go?
-[grunts]</b></font>

321
00:15:49,620 --> 00:15:50,660
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>[Rika grunts]</b></font>

322
00:16:01,380 --> 00:16:02,420
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>[gasps]</b></font>

323
00:16:06,470 --> 00:16:07,880
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>[Takako grunts]</b></font>

324
00:16:08,090 --> 00:16:09,300
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>[growls]</b></font>

325
00:16:09,340 --> 00:16:10,340
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>[cracks]</b></font>

326
00:16:10,390 --> 00:16:11,430
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>[gasps]</b></font>

327
00:16:12,760 --> 00:16:14,850
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>[TAKAKO] Thin Ice Breaker!</b></font>

328
00:16:23,520 --> 00:16:24,690
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>[scoffs]</b></font>

329
00:16:25,110 --> 00:16:26,190
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>The Sun, Moon, and Stars Squad
was Fujiwara Clan's assassins.</b></font>

330
00:16:26,610 --> 00:16:27,400
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>We lived in darkness and served
with selfless devotion.</b></font>

331
00:16:27,950 --> 00:16:28,820
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>We were even forbidden
from having our own names.</b></font>

332
00:16:29,070 --> 00:16:29,860
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>Yet that man
once granted me a name.</b></font>

333
00:16:29,990 --> 00:16:30,870
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>So he could execute me instead</b></font>

334
00:16:31,120 --> 00:16:31,830
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>for his crime
of slaying his own kin.</b></font>

335
00:16:32,120 --> 00:16:34,990
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>[scoffs] Fujiwara!</b></font>

336
00:16:35,330 --> 00:16:38,040
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>[RYU] I've still got
a strong appetite!</b></font>

337
00:16:38,410 --> 00:16:40,290
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>[growls]</b></font>

338
00:16:40,330 --> 00:16:42,460
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>Let's keep chowing down!</b></font>

339
00:16:44,130 --> 00:16:46,420
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>[TAKAKO]
It's always you, Fujiwara!</b></font>

340
00:16:46,460 --> 00:16:48,420
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>You're always getting in my way!</b></font>

341
00:16:48,800 --> 00:16:50,510
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>Are you that afraid of me?</b></font>

342
00:16:50,550 --> 00:16:53,220
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>Afraid of me
becoming my own person?</b></font>

343
00:16:53,260 --> 00:16:54,850
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>-[hisses]
-[grunts]</b></font>

344
00:16:58,850 --> 00:17:01,730
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>[NARRATOR] Okkotsu
defeated Dhruv Lakdawalla,</b></font>

345
00:17:02,400 --> 00:17:05,320
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>whose technique made
the path of his shikigami</b></font>

346
00:17:05,360 --> 00:17:06,570
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>into his domain,</b></font>

347
00:17:06,610 --> 00:17:10,240
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>which cut into anything
it touched.</b></font>

348
00:17:10,530 --> 00:17:11,490
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>[slashes]</b></font>

349
00:17:11,530 --> 00:17:12,820
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>[gasps]</b></font>

350
00:17:13,530 --> 00:17:15,950
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>[TAKAKO]
This is Dhruv's technique.</b></font>

351
00:17:17,040 --> 00:17:18,120
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>Does that mean</b></font>

352
00:17:18,160 --> 00:17:21,370
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>Okkotsu's technique is Copy?</b></font>

353
00:17:22,330 --> 00:17:24,130
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>[Yuta grunting]</b></font>

354
00:17:24,170 --> 00:17:25,550
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>[Takako grunting]</b></font>

355
00:17:27,300 --> 00:17:29,130
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>[Ryu grunting]</b></font>

356
00:17:30,550 --> 00:17:31,680
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>[punching]</b></font>

357
00:17:34,090 --> 00:17:36,560
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>[YUTA] I don't know
what my ancestors did to you,</b></font>

358
00:17:36,600 --> 00:17:38,770
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>but that has nothing
to do with me.</b></font>

359
00:17:38,810 --> 00:17:40,640
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>If you live only
for your own sake,</b></font>

360
00:17:40,690 --> 00:17:42,650
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>you're eventually
going to reach your limit.</b></font>

361
00:17:42,690 --> 00:17:43,810
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>[TAKAKO] Shut up!</b></font>

362
00:17:43,860 --> 00:17:45,940
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>Live for the sake of others?</b></font>

363
00:17:45,980 --> 00:17:48,230
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>You think I'll eventually
reach my limit?</b></font>

364
00:17:49,690 --> 00:17:52,070
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>Stop barking those things at me!</b></font>

365
00:17:52,110 --> 00:17:54,780
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>It's easy for you to say.
You've already become someone!</b></font>

366
00:17:54,820 --> 00:17:55,910
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>[snickers]</b></font>

367
00:17:59,620 --> 00:18:00,790
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>[grunts]</b></font>

368
00:18:01,870 --> 00:18:03,500
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>[♪ tense music playing]</b></font>

369
00:18:10,300 --> 00:18:11,800
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>[RYU] Quit your whining!</b></font>

370
00:18:12,170 --> 00:18:14,010
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>Because at this point,</b></font>

371
00:18:15,180 --> 00:18:18,060
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>words are meaningless!</b></font>

372
00:18:22,640 --> 00:18:24,480
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>[ALL] Domain Expansion!</b></font>

373
00:18:26,860 --> 00:18:29,320
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>Yuta! Give him back!</b></font>

374
00:18:29,860 --> 00:18:32,650
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>[TAKAKO] Even if it tries
to penetrate the barrier later.</b></font>

375
00:18:32,700 --> 00:18:34,320
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>[RYU]
I ain't gonna drag this out!</b></font>

376
00:18:34,360 --> 00:18:36,700
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>Let's settle this,
nice and sweet!</b></font>

377
00:18:39,080 --> 00:18:40,410
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>[NARRATOR] At that moment,</b></font>

378
00:18:40,450 --> 00:18:43,040
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>the black devil
of the modern age...</b></font>

379
00:18:43,080 --> 00:18:45,000
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>[KUROURUSHI] I told you,</b></font>

380
00:18:45,040 --> 00:18:47,750
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>I like the taste of iron!</b></font>

381
00:18:48,130 --> 00:18:50,210
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>[NARRATOR]
...flew into the barriers.</b></font>

382
00:18:51,210 --> 00:18:52,300
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>[all gasp]</b></font>

383
00:18:52,630 --> 00:18:55,590
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>[NARRATOR] Kurourushi
had completed parthenogenesis</b></font>

384
00:18:55,640 --> 00:18:57,260
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>before going dormant.</b></font>

385
00:18:58,640 --> 00:19:01,270
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>So Kurourushi
was still alive and well</b></font>

386
00:19:01,310 --> 00:19:02,600
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>as a cursed spirit.</b></font>

387
00:19:03,020 --> 00:19:04,980
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>The complex forces
of their domains</b></font>

388
00:19:05,020 --> 00:19:07,810
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>had been keeping
the three sorcerers in check.</b></font>

389
00:19:07,860 --> 00:19:09,440
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>But this intruder</b></font>

390
00:19:09,480 --> 00:19:11,030
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>was unexpected.</b></font>

391
00:19:11,530 --> 00:19:13,570
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>And so the barriers...</b></font>

392
00:19:16,200 --> 00:19:17,620
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>collapsed.</b></font>

393
00:19:22,830 --> 00:19:24,830
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>[TAKAKO]
How's Kurourushi still alive?</b></font>

394
00:19:24,870 --> 00:19:26,080
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>-[Yuta grunts]
-[Takako gasps]</b></font>

395
00:19:28,380 --> 00:19:30,090
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>-[grunts]
-[shatters]</b></font>

396
00:19:30,130 --> 00:19:32,010
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>[TAKAKO] Damn!
I can't use my technique</b></font>

397
00:19:32,050 --> 00:19:33,880
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>right after Domain Expansion.</b></font>

398
00:19:33,920 --> 00:19:35,340
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>-[Kurourushi growls]
-[Takako gasps]</b></font>

399
00:19:36,840 --> 00:19:40,760
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>[Rika chomping]</b></font>

400
00:19:40,810 --> 00:19:42,720
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>How dare you take my arm!</b></font>

401
00:19:42,770 --> 00:19:45,520
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>-Fujiwara!
-[RYU] Enough, Uro.</b></font>

402
00:19:45,560 --> 00:19:46,640
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>Quiet.</b></font>

403
00:19:47,600 --> 00:19:50,770
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>You and the roach were
never invited to my table.</b></font>

404
00:19:52,360 --> 00:19:54,030
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>Granite Blast.</b></font>

405
00:19:54,070 --> 00:19:55,360
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>[explosion]</b></font>

406
00:19:57,450 --> 00:20:01,030
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>[NARRATOR] Ishigori's technique
is Cursed Energy Discharge.</b></font>

407
00:20:01,080 --> 00:20:03,410
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>It's an extremely simple attack,</b></font>

408
00:20:03,450 --> 00:20:05,540
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>but it performs just as well,</b></font>

409
00:20:05,580 --> 00:20:08,920
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>even when his technique
is burnt out.</b></font>

410
00:20:09,880 --> 00:20:11,290
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>[Kurourushi growling]</b></font>

411
00:20:17,050 --> 00:20:18,090
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>Now.</b></font>

412
00:20:21,300 --> 00:20:23,390
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>Welcome to my table...</b></font>

413
00:20:24,770 --> 00:20:25,890
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>Okkotsu.</b></font>

414
00:20:27,020 --> 00:20:29,100
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>-Rika, let's go.
-[growls]</b></font>

415
00:20:33,570 --> 00:20:37,280
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>[NARRATOR] Okkotsu can discharge
a high volume of cursed energy,</b></font>

416
00:20:37,320 --> 00:20:40,410
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>but only while Rika
is completely manifested.</b></font>

417
00:20:40,450 --> 00:20:44,200
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>However, his maximum output
is slightly inferior</b></font>

418
00:20:44,240 --> 00:20:45,540
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>to Ishigori's.</b></font>

419
00:20:45,700 --> 00:20:48,750
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>So he planned to charge
and unleash his cursed energy</b></font>

420
00:20:48,790 --> 00:20:51,790
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>before Ishigori
reached maximum output.</b></font>

421
00:20:51,830 --> 00:20:54,380
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>- [Yuta gasps]
- But he changed his mind.</b></font>

422
00:20:55,090 --> 00:20:57,760
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>LET'S LET IT ALL OUT!</b></font>

423
00:20:57,800 --> 00:21:00,300
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>400 years of longing.</b></font>

424
00:21:00,760 --> 00:21:03,720
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>The intense gaze
full of that hunger</b></font>

425
00:21:03,760 --> 00:21:06,310
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>melted Yuta Okkotsu's heart,</b></font>

426
00:21:06,680 --> 00:21:09,810
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>even though he would
likely never find meaning</b></font>

427
00:21:09,850 --> 00:21:11,270
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>in fighting.</b></font>

428
00:21:12,860 --> 00:21:14,650
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>All right, just this once.</b></font>

429
00:21:16,530 --> 00:21:18,440
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>♪</b></font>

430
00:21:22,070 --> 00:21:23,030
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>[both grunt]</b></font>

431
00:21:23,070 --> 00:21:24,870
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>[♪ theme song playing]</b></font>

432
00:21:33,420 --> 00:21:36,960
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>That was some
seriously sweet stuff, Okkotsu!</b></font>

433
00:21:39,010 --> 00:21:40,090
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>[Yuta grunts]</b></font>

434
00:21:47,180 --> 00:21:48,720
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>Yeah, attaboy!</b></font>

435
00:21:48,770 --> 00:21:51,230
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>Let's keep
this dinner party going!</b></font>

436
00:21:54,560 --> 00:21:56,860
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>That big thing
can fire on its own?</b></font>

437
00:21:57,650 --> 00:21:58,730
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>But...</b></font>

438
00:21:59,610 --> 00:22:01,400
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>its force is weak!</b></font>

439
00:22:02,950 --> 00:22:05,830
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>After Domain Expansion
and a meal with me,</b></font>

440
00:22:06,160 --> 00:22:08,370
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>even you haven't had
enough time to digest</b></font>

441
00:22:08,410 --> 00:22:10,370
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>and recover your full strength.</b></font>

442
00:22:11,660 --> 00:22:13,250
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>I'll end this!</b></font>

443
00:22:13,330 --> 00:22:15,960
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>Granite Blast!</b></font>

444
00:22:17,710 --> 00:22:20,210
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>♪</b></font>

445
00:22:20,260 --> 00:22:22,090
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>[NARRATOR]
But Okkotsu's technique...</b></font>

446
00:22:23,760 --> 00:22:25,760
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>had already recovered.</b></font>

447
00:22:26,720 --> 00:22:27,720
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>[Ryu gasps]</b></font>

448
00:22:28,510 --> 00:22:30,390
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>[RYU]
He's using Uro's technique!</b></font>

449
00:22:31,180 --> 00:22:33,940
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>I knew he was more than just
a cursed speech user.</b></font>

450
00:22:34,310 --> 00:22:35,730
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>And I figured that big thing</b></font>

451
00:22:35,770 --> 00:22:37,020
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>probably had
a different technique</b></font>

452
00:22:37,060 --> 00:22:38,270
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>from Okkotsu's, too.</b></font>

453
00:22:38,610 --> 00:22:39,940
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>So that's it!</b></font>

454
00:22:39,980 --> 00:22:41,900
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>Okkotsu's technique is Copy!</b></font>

455
00:22:42,200 --> 00:22:44,400
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>But there should be
strenuous conditions on it.</b></font>

456
00:22:44,450 --> 00:22:46,280
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>When did he satisfy
those conditions?</b></font>

457
00:22:46,320 --> 00:22:47,280
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>While I wasn't looking?</b></font>

458
00:22:47,330 --> 00:22:48,910
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>Maybe there aren't any!</b></font>

459
00:22:49,620 --> 00:22:50,790
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>[Yuta grunts]</b></font>

460
00:22:53,660 --> 00:22:55,080
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>[RYU] That was when he did it!</b></font>

461
00:22:55,620 --> 00:22:56,880
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>[YUTA] Thin Ice Breaker!</b></font>

462
00:22:58,920 --> 00:22:59,840
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>[Ryu groans]</b></font>

463
00:22:59,880 --> 00:23:01,510
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>-[Rika growls]
-[Yuta grunts]</b></font>

464
00:23:06,470 --> 00:23:07,800
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>[beeps]</b></font>

465
00:23:08,390 --> 00:23:09,430
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>[NARRATOR] Five minutes.</b></font>

466
00:23:09,930 --> 00:23:13,350
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>Okkotsu's connection
to Rika was severed.</b></font>

467
00:23:13,770 --> 00:23:15,560
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>-[growls]
-[Yuta gasps]</b></font>

468
00:23:19,520 --> 00:23:20,980
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>[RIKA] Yuta!</b></font>

469
00:23:22,860 --> 00:23:23,900
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>[Yuta grunts]</b></font>

470
00:23:24,820 --> 00:23:26,530
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>[RYU] Is this the feeling?</b></font>

471
00:23:26,570 --> 00:23:27,700
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>[Yuta groans]</b></font>

472
00:23:28,820 --> 00:23:29,910
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>[grunts]</b></font>

473
00:23:30,240 --> 00:23:33,330
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>[RYU] There's still more
after going all out!</b></font>

474
00:23:33,370 --> 00:23:35,960
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>♪</b></font>

475
00:23:36,500 --> 00:23:37,920
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>This is what it's like</b></font>

476
00:23:38,290 --> 00:23:40,040
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>to eat dessert!</b></font>

477
00:23:55,350 --> 00:23:56,810
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>[chuckles, grunts]</b></font>

478
00:24:00,810 --> 00:24:01,860
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>[grunts]</b></font>

479
00:24:02,150 --> 00:24:03,400
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>[YUTA] We're done.</b></font>

480
00:24:07,070 --> 00:24:08,200
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>[RYU] What?</b></font>

481
00:24:08,660 --> 00:24:09,950
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>What does he mean?</b></font>

482
00:24:10,320 --> 00:24:11,200
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>[gasps]</b></font>

483
00:24:11,240 --> 00:24:13,830
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>♪</b></font>

484
00:24:23,550 --> 00:24:26,010
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>[panting]</b></font>

485
00:24:27,090 --> 00:24:29,760
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>Was that my technique?</b></font>

486
00:24:32,310 --> 00:24:33,600
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>I see.</b></font>

487
00:24:33,640 --> 00:24:35,680
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>He sent it sailing back to me</b></font>

488
00:24:35,720 --> 00:24:37,680
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>using Uro's technique.</b></font>

489
00:24:41,110 --> 00:24:42,770
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>Thank you, Okkotsu.</b></font>

490
00:24:43,150 --> 00:24:44,230
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>[cutlery clinks]</b></font>

491
00:24:49,410 --> 00:24:51,370
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>I'm full now.</b></font>

492
00:24:51,410 --> 00:24:52,490
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>[chuckles]</b></font>

493
00:24:54,740 --> 00:24:56,000
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>[thuds]</b></font>

494
00:25:02,380 --> 00:25:03,500
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>[gasps]</b></font>

495
00:25:06,800 --> 00:25:07,840
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>[sighs]</b></font>

496
00:25:09,300 --> 00:25:12,090
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>Okkotsu, you're too soft.</b></font>

497
00:25:12,140 --> 00:25:13,800
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>That's not a compliment.</b></font>

498
00:25:13,850 --> 00:25:16,600
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>Sparing the life of a sorcerer
who fought to kill you--</b></font>

499
00:25:16,640 --> 00:25:18,850
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>[YUTA] There's nothing
to gain from killing you.</b></font>

500
00:25:18,890 --> 00:25:20,560
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>Uro told me the same thing.</b></font>

501
00:25:21,230 --> 00:25:23,730
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>[RYU] You mean
that woman's still alive?</b></font>

502
00:25:24,820 --> 00:25:27,280
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>Well, I guess
my blast was weaker</b></font>

503
00:25:27,320 --> 00:25:29,360
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>after my Domain Expansion.</b></font>

504
00:25:29,400 --> 00:25:32,160
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>Hey, what was it
she kept going on about?</b></font>

505
00:25:32,660 --> 00:25:34,160
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>Were you having a lovers' spat?</b></font>

506
00:25:34,200 --> 00:25:36,040
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>Yeah, something like that.</b></font>

507
00:25:36,450 --> 00:25:38,200
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>Eh, don't let her get to ya.</b></font>

508
00:25:38,250 --> 00:25:40,160
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>[YUTA] There's nothing
I can say to that woman</b></font>

509
00:25:40,210 --> 00:25:41,500
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>to change her mind.</b></font>

510
00:25:42,040 --> 00:25:44,750
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>Anything I do say
will lead to violence.</b></font>

511
00:25:45,380 --> 00:25:48,340
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>You see,
it's because I'm blessed.</b></font>

512
00:25:48,380 --> 00:25:50,260
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>[Ryu sighs]
Is that how it works?</b></font>

513
00:25:50,300 --> 00:25:52,010
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>Because frankly, I don't get it.</b></font>

514
00:25:52,470 --> 00:25:55,180
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>[Yuta sighs] Well, regardless,</b></font>

515
00:25:55,890 --> 00:25:57,140
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>can I have your points?</b></font>

516
00:25:57,180 --> 00:25:58,220
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>Huh?</b></font>

517
00:25:59,930 --> 00:26:01,390
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>Now I get it.</b></font>

518
00:26:01,440 --> 00:26:03,350
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>So if we didn't
give you our points,</b></font>

519
00:26:03,400 --> 00:26:04,900
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>you would have killed us, right?</b></font>

520
00:26:05,560 --> 00:26:08,860
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>[Yuta grunts]
I'm not so sure about that.</b></font>

521
00:26:11,150 --> 00:26:12,410
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>[chuckles] All I know is</b></font>

522
00:26:12,450 --> 00:26:14,530
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>you should be grateful
to my friends.</b></font>

523
00:26:17,450 --> 00:26:20,750
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>THROUGH THE TRANSFER
OF RYU AND TAKAKO'S POINTS,</b></font>

524
00:26:20,950 --> 00:26:23,580
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>YUTA OKKOTSU
CAME TO POSSESS 190 POINTS.</b></font>

525
00:26:24,830 --> 00:26:26,340
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>[♪ melancholic music playing]</b></font>

526
00:26:26,380 --> 00:26:29,050
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>[TAKAKO] You're the one
who's going to reach your limit.</b></font>

527
00:26:32,800 --> 00:26:34,130
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>I've seen it.</b></font>

528
00:26:38,310 --> 00:26:41,100
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>Be it sorcerer or cursed spirit,</b></font>

529
00:26:41,350 --> 00:26:45,060
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>all are driven over the edge
by the same thing.</b></font>

530
00:26:45,100 --> 00:26:46,690
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>Overwhelming aggression</b></font>

531
00:26:46,730 --> 00:26:49,900
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>that blinds them
to everything else.</b></font>

532
00:26:49,940 --> 00:26:51,690
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>Like a calamity.</b></font>

533
00:26:56,740 --> 00:26:59,790
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>TO BE CONTINUED</b></font>

534
00:27:00,240 --> 00:27:02,410
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>[♪ closing theme song playing]</b></font>

